    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I remember my first time volunteering. I was seven years old. My older brother went out as a volunteer, and I went along to help. It was a warm but windy day. Everyone was in a good mood, and we completed our tasks ahead of time. I was too young to do any heavy lifting. Still, I felt a wave of excitement when we finished the project."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Fast forward twenty years. Now, I’m "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "addicted to",
            "zh": "醉心于"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that feeling. I’ve lent a helping hand to various animal protection organisations and worked as an animal keeper at a museum. Volunteering has brought me many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fond",
            "ref": "v-fond"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " memories."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many animal shelters in California are short-handed. My "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "professional",
            "ref": "v-professional"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " background is in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "marketing",
            "zh": "市场营销"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In my spare time, I help some of them with their management or serve as their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "webmaster",
            "zh": "网络管理员"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to keep their websites up to date. Beforehand, they didn’t have anybody filling those positions. It feels great to be able to use my professional knowledge and skills where "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "they"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are most needed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As you can see, I have a soft spot for animals. Even as a little kid, I wanted to be their voice. Recently, I started working at Rabbit Rescue as a “rabbit socialiser”. I spend two hours a week with the rabbits to help them become perfect pets. Sometimes, I just sit with them and help them get used to humans. Other times, I play with them so that they can get some exercise."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people say they feel tired after work and just want to lie down and do nothing. But what if you could do a little “extra work” for a very good "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cause",
            "ref": "v-cause"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? From my own experience, I’m sure you’ll be filled with "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "satisfaction",
            "ref": "v-satisfaction"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and excitement!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
